{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Your father's tribe.</b> It is Levi, and the Sages interpreted it literally. In my opinion, I interpreted it as if it said 'the tribe of Levi, which is your father's tribe.'" "<b>They shall be joined.</b> Like ונספחו ('and they shall be attached'), and likewise ילוה אישי ('my husband will be joined'). And note, the Levites are joined in their name [לוים from the root לוה]." "<b>And you and your sons with you.</b> You shall serve before the Tent of Meeting, you alone, and not the Levites."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:13.863526929Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}